        "t": 273.7537500000001,
        "r": 539.06325,
        "b": 220.49625000000003
      },
      "content": "This test measures patient auxiliary current in accordance with IEC60601-1, clause 19, for Class I, type CF equipment. The applied voltage for IEC60601-1 the voltage is 264 volts, 50 to 60 Hz. Patient auxiliary current is measured between each ECG test lead and between each sensor connection for all possible connections.",
